            <ArticleTitle>Prinzmetal's Variant Angina during cis-diamminodichloroplatinum (CDDP) administration: case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>89-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a rare case, the second in the literature, of Prinzmetal's Variant Angina (VA) caused by cis-diamminodichloroplatinum (CDDP) infusion. We also discuss the possible underlying mechanism of ischemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
